        <item>
            <title>1.0.3</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:37:35 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://noinnion.com/DiskCapa/</link>
            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li><b>Says what has grown.</b> After a scan, the list reports how much has
built up since the last one and which categories account for it. The menu bar
carries the same line.</li>
<li><b>Narrow the list.</b> Type to filter by name or path. If the filter hides
rows you had ticked, it says so — ticks are never removed by filtering, and
nothing hidden is deleted without being counted.</li>
<li><b>Look before you delete.</b> Preview any row: what a folder holds
directly, or a Quick Look of a file. Folders that cannot be read say so instead
of appearing empty.</li>
<li><b>Fixed.</b> Cancelling an AI review left its process running until a
watchdog killed it three minutes later.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
